mandatory product liability or any other mandatory statutory liability. Where a
material contractual duty is breached and exclusion is impermissible, liability
required by law remains in effect. Mandatory rights concerning fraudulently
concealed defects or an expressly assumed guarantee also remain unaffected.

5. Other rights and language versions

Mandatory statutory rights, including necessary backup copies, legally permitted
